{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.3"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-041",
    "title": "回返人间"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_263",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "他们已经离开归墟旧址，沿着天门投下的白痕向北走了三日。",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "洪流持续了整整一夜。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7470,
          "end": 7470
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "没有人知道天门之内究竟藏着多少人的记忆。它们像一场倒悬的暴雨，从门缝落下，又在广场上化作一颗颗半透明的水珠。每一颗水珠里都有人影，有的走过荒城，有的坐在灯下，有的抱着尚未出生的孩子。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7472,
          "end": 7472
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "有人伸手接住，哭了出来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7474,
          "end": 7474
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临站在石阶尽头，望着尚未闭合的门。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7492,
          "end": 7492
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "门内已经看不见陆沉舟。那道门像一只疲惫的眼睛，只留下一道窄缝。灰白光芒从缝里渗出，在地面铺成一条路，路的尽头指向北方。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7494,
          "end": 7494
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“北边是什么？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7496,
          "end": 7496
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜展开一张从废墟里找出的旧地图。地图的边缘被火烧掉，北方只剩一大片空白，空白中印着一个几乎看不清的官印。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7498,
          "end": 7498
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“天阙旧朝。”他说，“三百年前被抹去的国度。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7500,
          "end": 7500
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋抬起头：“不可能。天阙旧朝在典籍中从未存在过。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7502,
          "end": 7502
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“正因为从未存在，才最值得去看。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7504,
          "end": 7504
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜把地图递给陆照临。地图碰到他的手时，纸面忽然渗出血色，几行原本不存在的字缓慢浮现：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7506,
          "end": 7506
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“奉太虚天命，敕令诸宗。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7508,
          "end": 7508
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“凡持残印者，皆为天门逆徒。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7510,
          "end": 7510
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“凡见其踪者，杀无赦。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7512,
          "end": 7512
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "最下方是一片空白，没有日期，没有玺印，也没有签名。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7514,
          "end": 7514
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离皱眉：“这是诏书？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7516,
          "end": 7516
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“诏书必须有皇帝的名字。”沈砚秋摇头，“没有签名的诏书，只能算命令。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7518,
          "end": 7518
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“谁下的命令？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7520,
          "end": 7520
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "没人回答。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7522,
          "end": 7522
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "就在此时，远处传来整齐的脚步声。穿着黑底银纹道袍的修士越过残破山门，人数约有三百。他们没有携带宗门旗帜，腰间却各悬一枚白玉令牌，令牌上刻着同一个字：天。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7524,
          "end": 7524
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "为首的女子三十余岁，眉目冷峻，手中握着一卷没有展开的金色诏书。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7526,
          "end": 7526
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“太虚秩序巡界使，萧问蝉。”她在广场中央停步，“奉无名诏令，缉拿陆照临、顾长离、叶观澜，并收回归墟残印。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7528,
          "end": 7528
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜看了看她手里的诏书：“你的主上是谁？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7530,
          "end": 7530
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“天庭。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7532,
          "end": 7532
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“天庭的天帝是谁？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7534,
          "end": 7534
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "萧问蝉沉默一瞬：“不可问。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7536,
          "end": 7536
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“为何不可问？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7538,
          "end": 7538
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“问者，逆天。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7540,
          "end": 7540
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她说完，身后三百修士同时拔剑。剑锋没有指向陆照临，而是指向四周那些尚未散去的记忆水珠。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7542,
          "end": 7542
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临心中一沉：“你们要毁掉所有记忆？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7544,
          "end": 7544
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“记忆会制造混乱。”萧问蝉展开金色诏书，“天庭只承认统一的过去。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7546,
          "end": 7546
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "金纸上的字与地图上浮现的字一模一样。没有签名，却带着令万物俯首的威压。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7548,
          "end": 7548
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "归墟盟主忽然笑起来。他靠着断柱站起，指着那卷诏书：“看见了吗？你们终于来了。你们从不需要名字，因为所有人都已经替你们把命令执行完了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7550,
          "end": 7550
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "萧问蝉眼神一冷，袖中飞出一道银针，直刺盟主眉心。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7552,
          "end": 7552
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临抬指弹开银针，银针落地，化作一只细小的白色甲虫，甲虫背上刻着一行极小的字：抹除见证者。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7554,
          "end": 7554
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋看清后，脸色彻底变了。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7556,
          "end": 7556
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他们不是来抓我们的。”她说，“他们是来杀所有见过天门的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7558,
          "end": 7558
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "第一名天庭修士挥剑斩向记忆水珠。剑光触及水珠的一瞬，水珠里的人影发出惨叫，整片广场仿佛被撕掉了一块。紧接着，更多剑光升起，朝四面八方的水珠落去。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7560,
          "end": 7560
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "已记录。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-079",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7626,
          "end": 7626
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "诏书烧尽后的第三日，天庭的追杀令传遍了北境。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7636,
          "end": 7636
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "没有人看见它是如何传开的。清晨，所有城镇的墙上都出现了金色字迹；午后，过境商队的车轮上刻满了同样的命令；到了夜里，连荒山中的乌鸦都衔着细小的白玉片，在各处村落上空盘旋。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7638,
          "end": 7638
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "画像上的陆照临没有眼睛。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7640,
          "end": 7640
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离的画像没有脸。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7642,
          "end": 7642
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜则被画成一团持剑的黑影。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7644,
          "end": 7644
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "唯有沈砚秋的名字完整写在最下方，旁边标注四字：活捉记录。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7646,
          "end": 7646
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他们很清楚谁最危险。”沈砚秋把通缉令折起，收入袖中，“不是你们，是能证明他们改过历史的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7648,
          "end": 7648
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他们已经离开归墟旧址，沿着天门投下的白痕向北走了三日。白痕穿过荒原，穿过结冰的河床，沿途没有任何野兽靠近，仿佛地面仍记得天门的气息。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 7650,
          "end": 7650
        }
      }
    ],
